2. PA flies in parallel with rig (75m total)
3. Backline truck → backline on stage (45m)
4. Monitors → ring wedges (20m)
5. Soundcheck (60m) waits for house ring AND wedges ring
6. Band dinner (60m) after soundcheck
7. Show runs, backline out 15m after

